"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118013.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The full list of monitors has been tested on the current `master` branch, with editor builds, debug templates and release templates.\r\n\r\nEditor and debug template support the same set of monitors, while release templates support all monitors except 3 (`MEMORY_STATIC`, `MEMORY_STATIC_MAX` and `OBJECT_ORPHAN_NODE_COUNT`).\r\n\r\nThis also adds \"lower is better\" indications to monitors that were missing it.\r\n\r\n- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs-user-notes/discussions/485#discussioncomment-16353268.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_performance_monitors.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26358159/test_performance_monitors.zip)\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118013/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}